  "code": "class Solution:\n    def maxDepth(self, root):\n        # 先说明变量含义，再完成你的实现\n        def dfs(node):\n            if node is None:\n                return 0\n            \n            left_height = dfs(node.left)\n            right_height = dfs(node.right)\n\n            return max(left_height,right_height)+1\n\n        return dfs(root)\n",
